我永远都不会原谅自己的自私行为
that I'll never forgive myself for being so selfish.

373
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,230
我保证
And I promise

374
00:15:40,230 --> 00:15:41,900
有生之年
to keep you close

375
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:44,150
都会把你留在身边
for the rest of my life.

376
00:15:45,180 --> 00:15:49,580
亲娘的  这玩意要被摆到卧室了
Oh, no. That thing's gonna end up in my bedroom.

377
00:15:51,370 --> 00:15:53,290
没有了  问题都答完了
That's it! We're done with the questions.

378
00:15:53,290 --> 00:15:55,560
只剩下彼此凝视四分钟
All that's left to do is stare into each other's eyes

379
00:15:55,560 --> 00:15:57,090
不许说话
for four minutes without talking.

380
00:15:57,090 --> 00:15:57,870
好
Okay.

381
00:15:57,870 --> 00:15:59,040
等一下
Wait, hang on!

382
00:15:59,040 --> 00:16:00,680
膀胱检查
Bladder check.

383
00:16:02,690 --> 00:16:04,460
可以开始了
We're good to go.

384
00:16:06,270 --> 00:16:07,030
准备
You ready?

385
00:16:07,030 --> 00:16:07,710
好
Yes.

386
00:16:08,410 --> 00:16:11,240
现在开始
And begin.

387
00:16:25,590 --> 00:16:28,520
这样有点怪啊
This is kind of creepy.

388
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:30,490
这段期间我们不应该说话
We're not supposed to talk during this part.

389
00:16:30,490 --> 00:16:31,730
对不起
Sorry.

390
00:16:39,000 --> 00:16:40,990
这样有点怪啊
This is kind of creepy.

391
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,360
想停吗
Do you want to stop?

392
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,380
我知道你不喜欢目光交流
I know you have trouble with eye contact.

393
00:16:45,380 --> 00:16:50,470
你右眼虹膜上有个棕色小斑点
Well, you have a brown fleck in your right iris

394
00:16:50,470 --> 00:16:54,150
像一辆一级方程式赛车
that looks like a Formula One race car.

395
00:16:54,150 --> 00:16:58,320
所以  我就盯着它看好了
So... I'm just concentrating on that.

396
00:16:59,010 --> 00:17:00,440
而且和处着舒服的人在一起
Plus, it's easier around people

397
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:02,280
已经简单很多了
that I'm comfortable with.

398
00:17:02,280 --> 00:17:05,680
亲爱的  和你相处也很舒服
Aw, sweetie, I'm comfortable around you, too.

399
00:17:05,680 --> 00:17:08,970
当然  我是如此温暖的可人儿
Of course you are, I'm warm and soothing.

400
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:13,470
简直是一碗人形番茄汤
I'm like a human bowl of tomato soup.

401
00:17:14,350 --> 00:17:16,050
我是说把你当弟弟一样看
I meant more like a little brother.

402
00:17:18,610 --> 00:17:21,940
其实我真会把你当姐姐
Well, I suppose I do think of you as a sister.

403
00:17:22,860 --> 00:17:25,350
有时候当妈妈
And sometimes, a mother.

404
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,900
感觉又变怪了
It's getting creepy again.

405
00:17:35,950 --> 00:17:37,200
怎么了
What?

406
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:40,400
想到了第一天见到你和莱纳德
Just thinking about the day I met you and Leonard.

407
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:42,530
那是周一下午
It was a Monday afternoon.

408
00:17:42,530 --> 00:17:45,010
你来和我们一起吃印度餐
You joined us for Indian food.

409
00:17:45,490 --> 00:17:47,490
真不敢相信已经八年了
Can you believe it's been eight years?

410
00:17:47,490 --> 00:17:50,580
你还在蹭我们的饭
Yeah, and you're still eating our food.

411
00:17:54,240 --> 00:17:56,180
我...都记不起
I... can't remember a time

412
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:58,980
没有你们的生活是怎样的了
you guys weren't in my life.

413
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:01,630
我记得一清二楚
I remember it perfectly.

414
00:18:02,120 --> 00:18:05,060
因为我过目不忘
But I have an eidetic memory.

415
00:18:05,060 --> 00:18:07,370
如果你感兴趣
If you're interested, I also remember

416
00:18:07,370 --> 00:18:09,730
我还记得你总共欠我们多少饭钱
how much you owe us for the food.

417
00:18:14,760 --> 00:18:15,910
时间到了
That's it.

418
00:18:16,250 --> 00:18:17,380
还不算太糟
That wasn't so bad.

419
00:18:17,380 --> 00:18:18,930
真不算
No, it wasn't.

420
00:18:18,930 --> 00:18:22,640
现在我们来整理一下试验结果
Uh, now let's tabulate the results of the experiment.

421
00:18:23,410 --> 00:18:27,150
可以放心地说出  你没有爱上我
I think it's safe to say that you're not in love with me

422
00:18:27,150 --> 00:18:29,290
我也没有爱上你
and I'm not in love with you.

423
00:18:29,290 --> 00:18:31,700
而心理学再次自证了
And psychology has once again

424
00:18:31,700 --> 00:18:35,670
自己是科学中的蠢货
proved itself the doofus of the sciences.

425
00:18:37,020 --> 00:18:38,090
也许吧
Well, maybe.

426
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:40,420
但我还是很开心我们做了这个
But I'm still glad we did it.

427
00:18:40,420 --> 00:18:43,190
感觉和你更亲近了
I do feel closer to you.

428
00:18:43,880 --> 00:18:45,530
彼此彼此
And I, you.

429
00:18:45,880 --> 00:18:49,720
是的  这才是正确的表达方式
And yes, that's how you say that.

430
00:18:50,520 --> 00:18:54,180
考虑到我们新建立的亲密度
Yeah, so, given our newfound intimacy,

431
00:18:54,180 --> 00:18:56,740
有很多难以抉择的问题得做决定
I'd say we have some hard choices to make.

432
00:18:56,740 --> 00:18:57,880
比如什么
Like what?

433
00:18:57,880 --> 00:19:01,100
加里大会  我们开车去还是搭飞机
Gary Con-- do we fly or drive?

434
00:19:01,100 --> 00:19:03,380
扮还是不扮人物
Do we wear costumes?

435
00:19:03,380 --> 00:19:05,170
如果扮
And if so...

436
00:19:05,530 --> 00:19:07,860
谁来扮加里
who gets to be Gary?

437
00:19:12,790 --> 00:19:14,960
谢谢你送我回家
Thank you for walking me home.

438
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:17,360
只是想看你安全到家
I just want to make sure you get there safe.

439
00:19:19,030 --> 00:19:22,380
好了  我到家了
Well, this is me.

440
00:19:23,500 --> 00:19:25,570
今晚过得真有趣
It's been a very interesting evening.

441
00:19:25,570 --> 00:19:27,520
确实如此
It really has.

442
00:19:30,160 --> 00:19:32,350
惊喜
Surprise!

443
00:19:35,140 --> 00:19:38,160
我都让你扮加里了还这样
And after I let you be Gary!

